[188.643745, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22m#\u001b[11G{record.tx_mtosafisitepackage_landuses},\u001b[52Gin\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Geditor's\u001b[68Gorder,\u001b[75Gtranslated\u001b[86Gand\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m# without the hidden ones.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 5 \u001b[10G\u001b[22mt_content.mtosafi_landrates =< lib.contentElement\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[9G\u001b[22mtt_content.mtosafi_landrates {\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[9G\u001b[22m  templateName = LandRatesCalculator\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[9G\u001b[22m}\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[2B\u001b]8;id=199patw;file:///home/lina-wolf/projects/typo3/t3ca-2026/demo/packages/mtosafi_sitepackage/Resources/Private/Templates/Content/LandRatesCalculator.fluid.html\u0007Resources/Private/Templates/Content/LandRatesCalculator.fluid.html\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m61\u001b[22m lines to \u001b]8;id=199patw;file:///home/lina-wolf/projects/typo3/t3ca-2026/demo/packages/mtosafi_sitepackage/Resources/Private/Templates/Content/LandRatesCalculator.fluid.html\u0007\u001b[1mResources/Private/Templates/Content/LandRatesCalculator.fluid.html\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B<html \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mxmlns:f\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"http://typo3.org/ns/TYPO3/CMS/Fluid/ViewHelpers\"\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mdata-namespace-typo3-fluid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"true\"\u001b[39m>\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B<f:comme\u001b[19G>\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B \u001b[11G  Land rates calcula\u001b[32Gor (design/land-rates.h\u001b[56Gml), the rule of\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B \u001b[11G  design/docs/land-rates-calculation.md.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B    The rates are the elem\u001b[36Gnt's:\u001b[42Geach\u001b[47Gland\u001b[52Guse\u001b[56Gcarries\u001b[64Gits\u001b[68Gshare\u001b[74Gof\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Grateable\u001b[90Gvalue\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1