[385.586076, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow editors set the rates.\u001b[22m Each land use is a child record of the elem\u001b[74Gnt, with a name\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gpercentage\u001b[107Gof\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Grateable\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bvalue. The current ones are Residential 0.5 %, Commercial 1.2 % and Agricultural 0.2 %. Editors can add, reorder,\u001b[117Ghide\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band translate them. The minimum rate (KES 1,500) and the monthly interest (1 %) are fields on the element. A\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btranslation\u001b[15Gonly tr\u001b[23Gnsla\u001b[28Ges th\u001b[34G head\u001b[41Gg and the land use names, and always calculates\u001b[89Gwith\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98GEnglish\u001b[106Grates.\u001b[113GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign held\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gra\u001b[22Ges in one block o\u001b[40G JSON; I switched\u001b[58Gto\u001b[61Gchild\u001b[67Grecords\u001b[75Gso\u001b[78Geditors\u001b[86Gcan\u001b[90Gadd\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gland\u001b[101Guse\u001b[105Gwithout\u001b[113Gtouching\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe script.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mD\u001b[8Gabase:\u001b[22m the new\u001b[23Gtable\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gfields\u001b[40Gwere\u001b[45Gcreated\u001b[53Gas\u001b[56Gexpected.\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mServer-side rendering:\u001b[22m both languages\u001b[43Grender\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55Gtranslated\u001b[66Glabels,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gscript\u001b[89Gonly\u001b[94Gloads\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gpages\u001b[109Gthat\u001b[114Gcarry\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcalculator.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIn a real browser:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[28Gthree\u001b[34Gexamples\u001b[43Gin\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/land-rates-calculation.md\u001b[84G\u001b[39mcome\u001b[89Gout\u001b[93Gright\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gboth\u001b[107Glanguages\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(12,500 / 30,900\u001b[22G/ 1,500, the last one\u001b[44Gbeing the\u001b[54Gminimum rate). Both warnings\u001b[83Gappear when\u001b[95Gthey\u001b[100Gshould,\u001b[108Gmonths\u001b[115Gover\u001b[120G36\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcount as 36, and there are no script errors. The layout matches the design on desktop and at phone width. Amounts\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bshow as \"KES\" in English and as \"Ksh\" on the Kiswahili page.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent export:\u001b[22m the page and its records are in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[39m, and the diff only adds them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I couldn't check\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEditor side:\u001b[22m I wasn't\u001b[27Gallowed to creat\u001b[45Ga temporary backend admin,\u001b[72Gso I h\u001b[79Gv\u001b[81Gn'\u001b[84G s\u001b[87Gen the content\u001b[102Gwizard\u001b[109Gentry,\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bform or the page module preview. The icon and the el\u001b[58Gment\u001b[63Gare reg\u001b[72Gtered, bu\u001b[82G please open\u001b[95Gone\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gbackend.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFresh install:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mI\u001b[22Gdidn't\u001b[29Gtest\u001b[34Gimporting\u001b[44G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[53G\u001b[39minto\u001b[58Ga\u001b[60Gnew\u001b[64Ginstallation.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mTests:\u001b[22m the package h\u001b[26Gs none,\u001b[34Gso\u001b[37Gnone\u001b[42Gwere\u001b[47Gadded.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mThings to know\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  -\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[385.70568, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gvalue.\u001b[10GThe\u001b[14Gcurrent\u001b[22Gones\u001b[27Gare\u001b[31GResidential\u001b[43G0.5\u001b[47G%,\u001b[50GCommercial\u001b[61G1.2\u001b[65G%\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71GAgricultural\u001b[84G0.2\u001b[88G%.\u001b[91GEditors\u001b[99Gcan\u001b[103Gadd,\u001b[108Greorder,\u001b[117Ghide\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band translate them. The minimum\u001b[35Gr\u001b[37Gte\u001b[40G(KES 1,500) and the monthly int\u001b[72Gr\u001b[74Gs\u001b[76G (1 %)\u001b[84Gre fields\u001b[94Gon the elem\u001b[106Gnt.\u001b[110GA\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btranslation only \u001b[21Gra\u001b[24Gslates\u001b[31Gthe h\u001b[37Gad\u001b[40Gng\u001b[43Gand\u001b[47Gthe land use names,\u001b[71Galways calculates with \u001b[95Ghe English rat\u001b[110Gs. The\u001b[117G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign he\u001b[13Gd the rates in o\u001b[30Ge block of JSON; I switched to child records so editors can a\u001b[92Gd\u001b[94Ga land\u001b[101Gus\u001b[104G wi\u001b[108Ghout\u001b[113Gtouching\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bhe \u001b[8Gcript.\u001b[15G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDatabase:\u001b[15G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[19Gnew\u001b[23Gtable\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gfields\u001b[40Gwere\u001b[45Gcreated\u001b[53Gas\u001b[56Gexpected.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mServer-sid\u001b[16G rendering:\u001b[28G\u001b[22mboth\u001b[33Glanguages\u001b[43Grender\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55Gtranslated\u001b[66Glabels,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gscript\u001b[89Gonly\u001b[94Gloads\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gpages\u001b[109Gthat\u001b[114Gcarry\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcalculator.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIn a \u001b[11Geal browser:\u001b[22m the\u001b[28Gthree exampl\u001b[43Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/land-rates-calculation.md\u001b[39m come\u001b[90Gut right in both languages\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(12,500 / 30,900\u001b[22G/\u001b[24G1,500,\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Glast\u001b[40Gone\u001b[44Gbeing\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gminimum\u001b[62Grate).\u001b[69GBoth\u001b[74Gwarnings\u001b[83Gappear\u001b[90Gwhen\u001b[95Gthey\u001b[100Gshould,\u001b[108Gmonths\u001b[115Gover\u001b[120G36\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcount as 36, and ther\u001b[28Gare no script errors. The layout matches the design on desktop and at phone width. Amounts\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bshow as\u001b[13G\"KES\" in\u001b[22GEnglish and as \"Ksh\" on the\u001b[50GKiswahili page.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent export:\u001b[22m the page and its records are\u001b[50Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[39m, and th\u001b[85G diff\u001b[91Go\u001b[93Gly adds them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I couldn't check\u001b[25G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEditor side:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mI\u001b[20Gwasn't\u001b[27Gallowed\u001b[35Gto\u001b[38Gcreate\u001b[45Ga\u001b[47Gtemporary\u001b[57Gbackend\u001b[65Gadmin,\u001b[72Gso\u001b[75GI\u001b[77Ghaven't\u001b[85Gseen\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gcontent\u001b[102Gwizard\u001b[109Gentry,\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  form or the page module\u001b[29Gpreview.\u001b[38GThe\u001b[42Gicon\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gelement\u001b[63Gare\u001b[67Gregistered,\u001b[79Gbut\u001b[83Gplease\u001b[90Gopen\u001b[95Gone\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gbackend.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mFresh install:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mI didn't test importing \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m into \u001b[59G n\u001b[62Gw installation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTests:\u001b[22m the package has non\u001b[32G, so non\u001b[42Gwere\u001b[48Gd\u001b[50Ged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings to know\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GAn\u001b[8Gexisting\u001b[17G\"Editors\"\u001b[27Ggroup\u001b[33Gwon't\u001b[39Gget\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gnew\u001b[51Gtable.\u001b[58GOnly\u001b[63Ggroups\u001b[70Gcreated\u001b[78Gby\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gnew\u001b[87Gsetup\u001b[93Gdo,\u001b[97Gso\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gan\u001b[106Ginstallation\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  that already\u001b[18Ghas\u001b[22Gone,\u001b[27Gadd\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Gtable\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Ggroup\u001b[54Gby\u001b[57Ghand.\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[386.075783, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gand translate them. The\u001b[27Gminimum rate (KES 1,500) and the monthly interest (1 %) are fields on the element. A\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btransl\u001b[10Gtion only translates the\u001b[35Gheading and the l\u001b[56Gus\u001b[60Gnames, and always calculates with\u001b[94Gthe English rates.\u001b[113GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign held\u001b[15Gthe rates in one block of JSON;\u001b[47GI switched to child\u001b[67Grecords so\u001b[78Geditors can add\u001b[94Ga land use without\u001b[113Gtouching\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe script.\u001b[15G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mDatabas\u001b[13G:\u001b[22m the\u001b[19Gnew\u001b[23Gtable\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gfields\u001b[40Gwere\u001b[45Gcreated\u001b[53Gas\u001b[56Gexpected.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mServer-side rendering:\u001b[22m both\u001b[33Glanguages rend\u001b[48Gr with translated\u001b[66Glabels,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gscript\u001b[89Gonly\u001b[94Gloads\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gpages\u001b[109Gthat\u001b[114Gcarry\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcalculator.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIn a real browser:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[28Gthree\u001b[34Gexamples\u001b[43Gin\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/land-rates-calculation.md\u001b[84G\u001b[39mcome\u001b[89Gout\u001b[93Gright\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gboth\u001b[107Glanguages\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(12,500 / 30,900 /\u001b[24G1,500, the l\u001b[37Gst one being the minimum rate). Both warnings appear when t\u001b[97Gey should, months over\u001b[120G36\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcount as 36, and\u001b[22Gthere are no\u001b[35Gscript \u001b[43Grrors.\u001b[50GT\u001b[54Glayout matches\u001b[69Gthe design on\u001b[83Gdesktop and\u001b[95Gat phone width. Amounts\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bshow as \"KES\" in\u001b[22GEnglish and a\u001b[36G \"Ksh\" on the\u001b[50GKiswahili page.\u001b[K\r\u