[386.234297, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gtransl\u001b[10Gtion only translates the\u001b[35Gheading and the l\u001b[56Gus\u001b[60Gnames, and always calculates with\u001b[94Gthe English rates.\u001b[113GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign held\u001b[15Gthe rates in one block of JSON;\u001b[47GI switched to child\u001b[67Grecords so\u001b[78Geditors can add\u001b[94Ga land use without\u001b[113Gtouching\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe script.\u001b[15G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mDatabas\u001b[13G:\u001b[22m the\u001b[19Gnew\u001b[23Gtable\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gfields\u001b[40Gwere\u001b[45Gcreated\u001b[53Gas\u001b[56Gexpected.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mServer-side rendering:\u001b[22m both\u001b[33Glanguages rend\u001b[48Gr with translated\u001b[66Glabels,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gscript\u001b[89Gonly\u001b[94Gloads\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gpages\u001b[109Gthat\u001b[114Gcarry\u001b[120Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcalculator.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIn a real browser:\u001b[24G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[28Gthree\u001b[34Gexamples\u001b[43Gin\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/land-rates-calculation.md\u001b[84G\u001b[39mcome\u001b[89Gout\u001b[93Gright\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gboth\u001b[107Glanguages\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G(12,500 / 30,900 /\u001b[24G1,500, the l\u001b[37Gst one being the minimum rate). Both warnings appear when t\u001b[97Gey should, months over\u001b[120G36\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcount as 36, and\u001b[22Gthere are no\u001b[35Gscript \u001b[43Grrors.\u001b[50GT\u001b[54Glayout matches\u001b[69Gthe design on\u001b[83Gdesktop and\u001b[95Gat phone width. Amounts\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bshow as \"KES\" in\u001b[22GEnglish and a\u001b[36G \"Ksh\" on the\u001b[50GKiswahili page.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent export:\u001b[22m the page\u001b[34Gits records\u001b[46Gar\u001b[50Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitia