[502.615557, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mEditors maintain the rates in the element, as land use records with a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bshare of the rateable value plus a minimum and a monthly interest, so a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnew rate needs \u001b[19Go change to the script. Tran\u001b[48Glations translate\u001b[66Gonly\u001b[71Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnames\u001b[9Gand calculate with the rates\u001b[38Gof the default language.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 6m 11s · done 3:48 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m The rates change every year. Who changes them, and how?\u001b[39m                                                               \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m An editor changes them in the backend by editing the calculator on the \"Land rates\" page. No developer is needed for\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Grates\u001b[13Gthemselves,\u001b[25Gbut\u001b[29Ga\u001b[31Gfew\u001b[35Gother\u001b[41Gplaces\u001b[48Gon\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gsite\u001b[60Galso\u001b[65Gstate\u001b[71Gthem\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Ghave\u001b[85Gto\u001b[88Gbe\u001b[91Gupdated\u001b[99Galongside.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWho\u001b[7G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BAnyone\u001b[10Gin\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17G\"Editors\"\u001b[27Ggroup,\u001b[34Gor\u001b[37Gan\u001b[40Gadministrator.\u001b[55GOne\u001b[59Gcatch:\u001b[66Gonly\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Ggroup\u001b[79Gcreated\u001b[87Gby\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gnew\u001b[96Gsetup\u001b[102Gcan\u001b[106Gedit\u001b[111Gland\u001b[116Guses.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOn\u001b[6Gan\u001b[9Ginstallation\u001b[22Gwhose\u001b[28G\"Editors\"\u001b[38Ggroup\u001b[44Galready\u001b[52Gexisted,\u001b[61Gan\u001b[64Gadministrator\u001b[78Gmust\u001b[83Gfirst\u001b[89Gadd\u001b[93G\"Land\u001b[99Guse\"\u001b[104Gto\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Ggroup's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btables\u001b[10G(Syst\u001b[16Gm > Backend users\u001b[34G> the\u001b[40Ggroup > Access\u001b[55Glists). Otherwise\u001b[73Geditors c\u001b[83Gn open\u001b[90Gthe calculator but can't change\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe land uses.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow\u001b[7G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B1. Open\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15GPage\u001b[20Gmodule\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35G\"Land\u001b[41Grates\"\u001b[48Gpage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6GEdit\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15G\"Land\u001b[21Grates\u001b[27Gcalculator\"\u001b[39Gelement:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G- U\u001b[10Gder \"L\u001b[17Gnd\u001b[20Guses\",\u001b[27Gchange each \"Rate (%\u001b[48Gof the\u001b[55Grateable\u001b[64Gvalue\u001b[70Gper\u001b[74Gyear)\".\u001b[82GThis\u001b[87Gis\u001b[90Galso\u001b[95Gwhere\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gland\u001b[108Guse\u001b[112Gis\u001b[115Gadded,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G  remov\u001b[14Gd or reord\u001b[25Gred.\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
