e\u001b[64Gnew\u001b[68Grates\u001b[74Gshow\u001b[79Gon\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gnext\u001b[91Gvisit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe editor only change\u001b[27Gthe English element\u001b[50Ge Kiswahili p\u001b[64Gge calcu\u001b[73Gates with\u001b[87GEnglish rates, so there is nothing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto\u001b[6Gchange there, unless a land use is added. That one needs\u001b[65GKiswahili name on the tr\u001b[90Gnslation, otherwise it\u001b[113Gapp\u001b[117Gars\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin Englis\u001b[13G on the Kiswahili\u001b[31Gpage.\u001b[37GI\u001b[39Ghaven't\u001b[47Gactually\u001b[56Gtested\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Grate\u001b[70Gchange\u001b[77Gfollowed\u001b[86Gby\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Glook\u001b[96Gat\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103GKiswahili\u001b[113Gpage;\u001b[119GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan\u001b[7Grun\u001b[11Gthat\u001b[16Gtest.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat else states the rates\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe calculator does\u001b[23G'\u001b[25G upd\u001b[30Gt\u001b[33Gthese, so the \u001b[76Gthe same\u001b[85Gsession:\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
