rateable\u001b[64Gvalue\u001b[70Gper\u001b[74Gyear)\".\u001b[82GThis\u001b[87Gis\u001b[90Galso\u001b[95Gwhere\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gland\u001b[108Guse\u001b[112Gis\u001b[115Gadded,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8Gremoved or reordered.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B-\u001b[8GChang\u001b[14G \"Minimum rate (KES\u001b[34Gper\u001b[38Gplot\u001b[43Gand\u001b[47Gyear)\"\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58G\"Interest\u001b[68Gwhen\u001b[73Gpaid\u001b[78Glate\u001b[83G(%\u001b[86Gper\u001b[90Gmonth)\"\u001b[98Gif\u001b[101Gthey\u001b[106Gchange\u001b[113Gtoo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6GSave. Saving the elem\u001b[28Gnt clears\u001b[38Gtha\u001b[43Gpage's cache, so th\u001b[63G new\u001b[68Grates show on the\u001b[86Gn\u001b[88Gxt visit.\u001b[98G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Geditor\u001b[14Gonly\u001b[19Gchanges\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31GEnglish\u001b[39Gelement.\u001b[48GThe\u001b[52GKiswahili\u001b[62Gpage\u001b[67Gcalculates\u001b[78Gwith\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87GEnglish\u001b[95Grates,\u001b[102Gso\u001b[105Gthere\u001b[111Gis\u001b[114Gnothing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto change there, unles\u001b[27Ga land use is added\u001b[50Gat one needs \u001b[64G Kiswahi\u001b[73Gi name on\u001b[87Gtranslation, otherwise it appears\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[6GEnglish on the Kiswahili page. I haven't actually tested\u001b[65Grate change followed by \u001b[90G look at the Kiswahili\u001b[113Gpag\u001b[117G; I\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan run t\u001b[13Gat test.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat else states the rates\u001b[22m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
